      "text": "Galio fires two windblasts that deal (70/105/140/175/210 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage each. When the windblasts meet, they combine into a tornado that deals (8 + (4% Ability Power))max Health magic damage over 2 seconds. Percent Health damage deals a max of 200 damage to jungle monsters.",
